	title = {Analysis of the translocon-associated protein alpha subunit (TRAPα) gene and association study of TRAPα with WSSV resistance in Litopenaeus vannamei; 凡纳滨对虾易位子相关蛋白α 亚基(TRAPα)基因解析及其与WSSV 抗性的关联},
